OL,3,GNEWSAThunderbirds style property goes
OL,4,Ato auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA property, reminiscent of the house
OL,7,Fmade famous by the 1960s TV series
OL,8,FThunderbirds, is being offered for
OL,9,Fauction this month.
OL,11,FLike the Thunderbirds' secret Tracy
OL,12,FIsland HQ, the site on Long Lane in
OL,13,FTilehurst, Berkshire features an
OL,14,F"extensive" network of tunnels and
OL,15,Funderground rooms. While it does not
OL,16,Fhave the space-age monorail system
OL,17,Ffeatured in the TV show, there is a
OL,18,Fhand-built underground railway.
OL,20,FThe subterranean network below the site
OL,21,Fdescends through four levels, reaching
OL,22,Fmore than 15m (49ft) below ground.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
